  )
  (text "DOMAIN 1: MAINS / HOT SIDE (GND_AC = NEUTRAL)\nL_AC -> F1 (0.5A) -> R1..R5 (5x390k 1%) -> R6 (510R) || C3 (68nF) -> BL0942 VP (Pin 4)\nCT Clamp (J2) -> R9||R10 (0.5R Burden) + D1 (SMAJ5.0CA) -> R7,R8 (510R) + C4,C5 (68nF) -> BL0942 IP/IN (Pins 2,3)\nU1 BL0942: Pin1 VDD=3.3V_ISO, Pin5 GND=GND_AC, Pin7 SEL=GND_AC (UART), Pin8 SCLK_BPS=GND_AC (4800bps)\nU1 Pin9 RX <- R11(5.1k pullup) <- U3 ADuM1201 VO1 (Pin7) | U1 Pin10 TX -> R12(5.1k pullup) -> U3 VI2 (Pin6)"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25 45 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001")
  )
  (text "GALVANIC ISOLATION BARRIER (>= 6.5 mm)\nU2 B0505S-1WR3: +5V_SAFE / GND_SAFE -> +5V_ISO -> U6 ME6211-3.3 -> +3.3V_ISO / GND_AC\nU3 ADuM1201ARZ: Side 1 (+3.3V_SAFE, GND_SAFE) <==> Side 2 (+3.3V_ISO, GND_AC)\nPS1 HLK-PM01 (Off-board Bay): L/N 220VAC -> +5V_SAFE / GND_SAFE (4000VAC Isolation)"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25 95 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "a1000002-0000-4000-8000-000000000002")
  )
  (text "DOMAIN 2: SAFE LOW-VOLTAGE SIDE (GND_SAFE)\n+5V_SAFE -> U5 ME6211-3.3 -> +3.3V_SAFE (C1 10uF, C8 10uF, C2 100nF)\nU4 ESP32-C3 SuperMini:\n  GPIO0 (UART1 RX) <- U3 ADuM1201 VO2 (Pin3)\n  GPIO1 (UART1 TX) -> U3 ADuM1201 VI1 (Pin2)\n  GPIO4(SCK), GPIO6(MOSI), GPIO7(RES), GPIO5(DC), GPIO10(CS), GPIO3(BLK) -> J3 TFT IPS 1.3in\n  GPIO9 <- SW1 (PAIR/PAGE Tactile Button to GND_SAFE)\n  GPIO21 -> R14(1k) -> LED2 (WIFI Blue) | +3.3V_SAFE -> R13(1k) -> LED1 (PWR Amber)"
